; Disposable WB 3.1 Which result-code probe. Output is retained in S:Shell-Startup.
FailAt 21
Path C:
Echo "BEGIN" >S:Shell-Startup
Resident >NIL: C:Execute PURE
C:Which Execute >>S:Shell-Startup
Echo "EXECUTE RC=$RC RESULT2=$Result2" >>S:Shell-Startup
C:Which Execute RES >>S:Shell-Startup
Echo "RES RC=$RC RESULT2=$Result2" >>S:Shell-Startup
C:Which Execute NORES >>S:Shell-Startup
Echo "NORES RC=$RC RESULT2=$Result2" >>S:Shell-Startup
C:Which Execute ALL >>S:Shell-Startup
Echo "ALL-EXECUTE RC=$RC RESULT2=$Result2" >>S:Shell-Startup
C:Which CD ALL >>S:Shell-Startup
Echo "ALL-CD RC=$RC RESULT2=$Result2" >>S:Shell-Startup
C:Which CopperOSMissingCommand >>S:Shell-Startup
Echo "MISSING RC=$RC RESULT2=$Result2" >>S:Shell-Startup
Resident >NIL: Execute REMOVE
Echo "END" >>S:Shell-Startup
EndCLI >NIL:
